The Wick is the professor [[People/Althane/Ashmont|Ashmont]]'s name for the universe seen as a single point in an amazingly large but finite [[Phenomena/Configuration Space|configuration space]], which he calls Ashmont Space. Move to a different point in that space and the world is different, and that is magic. He is right: to cast a spell is to move from one point in configuration space to another. Spells, invocations and rituals are ways of encoding the vector of travel, and energy from the [[Phenomena/Aetheric Field|aether]] is the fuel for the journey.

Other points in the space are other realities. [[Org/Althane/The Weft|The Weft]] were thrown into an alternate wick by [[People/Althane/Rowan|Rowan]]'s explosion, a hellscape where they found [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawn]].
